---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
---
<MainLayout title="AC Services | Maharashtra AC Service & Repair" description="Explore AC service, repair, installation, gas service and maintenance options across Pune and Mumbai.">
<Header /><main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Our Services</span><h1>Complete AC care for homes & businesses.</h1><p>Explore common air conditioner service, repair, installation and maintenance requirements. Choose a service to learn more or contact the team directly.</p><div class="service-hero-actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Request Service</a><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="tel:+917378351743">Call 73783 51743</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container service-list">{[
["❄","AC Service","Cleaning, inspection and performance checks for better everyday cooling."],["⚙","AC Repair","Troubleshooting for cooling, noise, water leakage and common operational issues."],["＋","AC Installation","Installation support for new split and other AC systems."],["↗","AC Uninstallation","Careful AC removal for relocation, replacement or renovation work."],["◌","AC Gas Filling","Refrigerant-related inspection and service when cooling performance drops."],["⌁","AC Gas Leakage Repair","Inspection and repair support when refrigerant leakage is suspected."],["✓","AC Maintenance","Preventive maintenance to help keep your AC efficient and dependable."],["▣","Split AC Service","Focused cleaning and maintenance support for split air conditioners."],["▤","Window AC Service","Cleaning, inspection and repair support for window AC units."],["▥","Cassette AC Service","Maintenance and repair support for cassette AC systems."],["✦","AC Not Cooling","Troubleshooting support for weak or uneven cooling performance."],["↻","AC Relocation","Uninstallation and installation support when moving an AC to another location."]
].map(([icon,title,text],i)=><article class={`card service-card reveal delay-${(i%3)+1}`}><div class="icon">{icon}</div><h2>{title}</h2><p>{text}</p><a class="service-link" href="/contact/">Request this service <span>→</span></a></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section section--soft"><div class="container service-info"><div><span class="eyebrow">When To Book</span><h2>Routine care can be easier than emergency repair.</h2><p>Consider arranging service when airflow drops, filters become heavily soiled, cooling is uneven, water leakage appears, unusual sounds develop or the AC has not been maintained for a long period.</p></div><div class="check-list"><span>✓ Before peak summer usage</span><span>✓ After long periods without use</span><span>✓ When cooling performance changes</span><span>✓ When unusual noise or leakage appears</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container process"><div><span class="eyebrow">Simple Process</span><h2>From enquiry to service, without the clutter.</h2><p>Tell us your location and AC requirement, then use the available contact options to start the enquiry.</p></div><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Contact</h3><p>Call, email or WhatsApp with your requirement.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Discuss</h3><p>Share the issue, AC type and service details.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Service</h3><p>Proceed with the appropriate support.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--soft"><div class="container service-note"><span class="eyebrow">Pune & Mumbai</span><h2>Local service information for both cities.</h2><p>Use the city pages for area-specific information, including Mumbai coverage across Andheri, Bandra, Powai, Borivali, Kandivali, Malad, Goregaon, Vile Parle, Kurla, Ghatkopar, Chembur and Thane.</p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/service-areas/">View Service Areas</a></div></section>
</main><CTA /><Footer /></MainLayout>
<style>
.page-hero{padding:98px 0}.page-hero p{max-width:780px;font-size:1.08rem}.service-hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px}.service-list{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.service-card{padding:26px}.icon{width:48px;height:48px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:14px;background:var(--blue-light);color:var(--blue);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:20px;transition:transform .3s ease,background .3s ease}.service-card:hover .icon{transform:rotate(-6deg) scale(1.08);background:#dcedfc}.service-card h2{font-size:1.35rem}.service-card p{min-height:78px}.service-link{color:var(--orange-dark);font-weight:850}.service-link span{display:inline-block;transition:transform .2s ease}.service-card:hover .service-link span{transform:translateX(5px)}.service-info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}.check-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.check-list span{padding:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;font-weight:750;color:var(--navy)}.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:60px;align-items:start}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.steps>div{padding:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.steps b{color:var(--orange);font-size:.75rem}.steps h3{margin-top:15px}.steps p{font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0}.service-note{max-width:900px}.service-note p{max-width:820px}@media(max-width:900px){.service-list{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.service-info,.process{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:560px){.service-list,.steps,.check-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>